        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"9666e9fe-0bc2-4e4c-8842-2162be0b6610\",\"review_text\":\"I am Musalman I hate your app😡😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"7f27bbab-ef19-4fb1-80d8-cd014da3e002\",\"review_text\":\"I HATE the new update , the app is also not showing lyrics and I also can't add songs to queue. Listening to music on Spotify is now a painful experience.\"},{\"review_id\":\"dc1041ce-994c-4553-a4ad-43cf76c62590\",\"review_text\":\"Nice app\"},{\"review_id\":\"ed15bb17-865a-492b-ba1b-268f4cab78f6\",\"review_text\":\"Very good app enna advertisement verudu premium best\"},{\"review_id\":\"66a29b3c-c14d-440e-b722-b23e0c99ae82\",\"review_text\":\"App is stuck on loading/logo screen\"},{\"review_id\":\"c3a06276-8d6a-408c-8d8a-000873a2ac62\",\"review_text\":\"Works for me!\"},{\"review_id\":\"7f057d48-0855-4325-950b-44f9e6fc2ee1\",\"review_text\":\"Disgusting app 1 minute of add after every 2 songs i am buying amazon prime music. Do something on this situation or your app will be meme material in future #Garibapp bhikari app\"},{\"review_id\":\"0c705bfc-7d24-4ce7-97c9-d701686750e9\",\"review_text\":\"Good\"},{\"review_id\":\"9d15352b-b78f-477b-b56f-44a6698ba55a\",\"review_text\":\"Like it, pretty much can enjoy what I,m hearing 75 percent of every day\"},{\"review_id\":\"f6f9c680-0970-443f-b422-b1a6ad85e7ce\",\"review_text\":\"@spotifyindia worst one ever my premium account got logged out automatically which was linked with my phone number now when I try to log in using my phone number it shows check your number and try again even though my number is correct. What the hell...\"}]}"
